lsp-plugins-lv2: lsp-plugins-lv2 (LSP audio plugin suite, LV2 build)
lsp-plugins-lv2:
lsp-plugins-lv2: Linux Studio Plugins: a large suite of audio processing plugins.
lsp-plugins-lv2: Built with FEATURES=lv2 only, so no CLAP, VST, LADSPA, GStreamer
lsp-plugins-lv2: or standalone JACK binaries are produced.
lsp-plugins-lv2:
lsp-plugins-lv2: Required by asahi-audio, whose PipeWire filter chain uses the
lsp-plugins-lv2: loud_comp, compressor and mb_compressor plugins from this suite.
lsp-plugins-lv2: REQUIRED by asahi-audio: supplies its compressor/loudness DSP.
lsp-plugins-lv2: Bundles install to /usr/lib64/lv2 so hosts can find them.
lsp-plugins-lv2: Homepage: https://lsp-plug.in/
